# CapitalForge Project Rules

## Startup Protocol (Every Chat)

1. **Read first:** `project-operating-system/docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`
2. **Check task scope:** `project-operating-system/docs/FEATURE_BACKLOG.md`
3. **Load domain skill:** `project-operating-system/skills/<domain>-skill.md`
4. **Check known issues:** `project-operating-system/docs/KNOWN_ISSUES.md`

## Scope Discipline

- **Never refactor unrelated modules** — if the task is strategy, don't touch auth or analytics
- **Keep features isolated** — one feature per PR, one module focus
- **Prefer modular code** — extend existing NestJS modules, don't create parallel implementations
- **Prefer reusable components** — use shadcn/ui, extend `lib/api.ts`, don't duplicate axios calls
- **Minimize diff scope** — simplest correct fix wins over elegant rewrites

## Documentation Updates (Required After Work)

| Change Type | Update |
|-------------|--------|
| Any work session | `docs/TIME_LOG.md` — append daily entry |
| Feature progress | `docs/FEATURE_BACKLOG.md` — status, progress % |
| Architectural decision | `docs/DECISION_LOG.md` — new ADR |
| New bug discovered | `docs/KNOWN_ISSUES.md` |
| API endpoint added/changed | `docs/API_CONTRACTS.md` |
| Production release | `docs/RELEASE_NOTES.md` |

## Business Logic Authority

- **PRD.md** is the source of truth for business rules
- Budget derivation chain: `totalBudget → allocationUSD → buckets → weeklyDCA → buyUSD = weeklyDCA × multiplier`
- Strategy rules store **multipliers** (1, 3, 5), never raw USD or share counts
- Bucket ratios default: 0.60 / 0.30 / 0.10 (must sum to 1.0)
- DCA weeks: 48 (not 52) unless portfolio setting changed

## Module Boundaries

| Module | Path | Touch When |
|--------|------|------------|
| Strategy | `backend/src/strategy/` | Buy signals, snapshots, rules |
| Allocation | `backend/src/allocation/` | Buckets, positions, recalc |
| Transaction | `backend/src/transaction/` | Ledger, import, side effects |
| Frontend | `frontend/src/app/` | Pages, UI |
| API Client | `frontend/src/lib/api.ts` | HTTP methods |

## Anti-Patterns (Never Do)

- Refactor code outside task scope
- Use JS `number` for money (use Prisma Decimal)
- Add axios calls outside `lib/api.ts`
- Store raw buy amounts in StrategyRule
- Skip updating backlog/time log after work
- Add dependencies without DECISION_LOG entry
- Enable or retain AuthBypassMiddleware in production

